CLIENT["1 Client"]:::plain
GATEWAY["2 Gateway"]:::plain
POOL["3 InferencePool"]:::plain
ROUTER["4 llm-d Router EPP"]:::orange
SIDECAR["5 Decode sidecar"]:::decode
VLLM["6 Decode vLLM"]:::decode
PREFILL["Prefill"]:::prefill
NOTE1["Gateway / HTTPRoute forwards the user request to the model's InferencePool.\nllm-d Router EPP decides whether prefill is needed and picks the role-specific backends.\nDecode remains the coordination point; the client still sees one endpoint."]:::note
NOTE2["Prefill is conditional, not mandatory.\nKV transfer bridges prefill and decode.\nResponse streaming returns through the decode path."]:::blueNote

CLIENT --> GATEWAY
GATEWAY --> POOL
POOL --> ROUTER
ROUTER --> SIDECAR
SIDECAR --> VLLM
ROUTER --> PREFILL
PREFILL -.-> SIDECAR
CLIENT -.-> NOTE1
SIDECAR -.-> NOTE2

